---
import DocsLayout from '../../layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
import PageHeader from './PageHeader.astro';
import Callout from './Callout.astro';

interface Props { lang: 'en' | 'id' }
const { lang } = Astro.props;
const id = lang === 'id';
const internalDefaults = [
  ['HTTP', '0.0.0.0:3000', id ? 'Alamat aplikasi tetap di dalam container.' : 'Fixed application address inside the container.'],
  ['Host publish', '127.0.0.1:3000', id ? 'Compose hanya expose ke loopback.' : 'Compose exposes only to loopback.'],
  ['Data', '/app/data', id ? 'Root persistent volume.' : 'Persistent volume root.'],
  ['WhatsApp auth', '/app/data/auth', id ? 'Baileys multi-file auth state.' : 'Baileys multi-file auth state.'],
  ['Request body', '32kb', id ? 'Batas JSON body.' : 'JSON body limit.'],
  ['Country code', '62', id ? 'Normalisasi nomor lokal Indonesia.' : 'Indonesian local-number normalization.'],
  ['Logging', 'enabled / info', id ? 'Structured request/runtime logging production.' : 'Structured production request/runtime logging.'],
  ['Credential bootstrap', 'first Pair WhatsApp', id ? 'Kandidat key dibuat otomatis saat Pair WhatsApp pertama dan server hanya menyimpan hash.' : 'A key candidate is created automatically on the first Pair WhatsApp action and the server stores only its hash.'],
  ['Browser origin', 'request Host', id ? 'Origin dashboard dideteksi dari host request; tidak membutuhkan CORS_ORIGIN.' : 'Dashboard origin is derived from the request host; CORS_ORIGIN is not required.'],
  ['Secure auth cookie', 'enabled in production', id ? 'Cookie bootstrap HttpOnly menggunakan Secure pada production.' : 'The bootstrap HttpOnly cookie uses Secure in production.'],
  ['Trust proxy', 'false', id ? 'Tidak diekspos sebagai operator setting.' : 'Not exposed as an operator setting.'],
  ['WA version strategy', 'Baileys default', id ? 'Tidak dipaksa melalui environment variable.' : 'Not forced through an environment variable.'],
];
---

<DocsLayout title={id ? 'Konfigurasi' : 'Configuration'}>
  <PageHeader
    eyebrow="Zero config"
    title={id ? 'Production tanpa file environment' : 'Production without an environment file'}
    description={id
      ? 'Deployment default Wago tidak membutuhkan .env, CORS_ORIGIN, atau API key yang disiapkan operator.'
      : 'The default Wago deployment does not require .env, CORS_ORIGIN, or an operator-provisioned API key.'}
  />

  <Callout title={id ? 'Tidak ada setup secret sebelum start' : 'No pre-start secret setup required'}>
    {id
      ? 'Jalankan container, buka dashboard dari domain publik Wago, lalu klik Pair WhatsApp. API key dibuat otomatis sebagai bagian dari flow tersebut. Raw key hanya tersedia di browser; backend menyimpan hash-nya.'
      : 'Start the container, open the dashboard from the public Wago domain, then click Pair WhatsApp. The API key is created automatically as part of that flow. The raw key is only available to the browser; the backend persists its hash.'}
  </Callout>

  <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#fafafa] mt-9 mb-3">{id ? 'Model origin browser' : 'Browser-origin model'}</h2>
  <p class="text-sm text-[#a1a1aa] leading-relaxed mb-4">{id ? 'Dashboard dan API production sengaja berjalan pada origin yang sama. Wago membandingkan header Origin browser dengan Host request untuk first-run bootstrap dan perubahan state berbasis cookie. Karena itu operator tidak perlu menyinkronkan CORS_ORIGIN dengan domain reverse proxy.' : 'The production dashboard and API intentionally share one origin. Wago compares the browser Origin header with the request Host for first-run bootstrap and cookie-authenticated state changes. Operators therefore do not need to keep a CORS_ORIGIN value synchronized with the reverse-proxy domain.'}</p>
  <p class="text-sm text-[#71717a] leading-relaxed mb-9">{id ? 'Cross-origin browser API tidak diaktifkan secara default. Integrasi eksternal sebaiknya menggunakan HTTP client/server-to-server dengan Authorization: Bearer <API_KEY>.' : 'Cross-origin browser API access is not enabled by default. External integrations should use an HTTP/server-to-server client with Authorization: Bearer <API_KEY>.'}</p>

  <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#fafafa] mb-4">{id ? 'Default internal' : 'Internal defaults'}</h2>
  <p class="text-sm text-[#a1a1aa] leading-relaxed mb-4">{id ? 'Nilai berikut sengaja berada di code agar deployment satu-instance tetap kecil dan predictable.' : 'These values intentionally live in code so the single-instance deployment stays small and predictable.'}</p>
  <div class="overflow-x-auto">
    <table class="w-full text-sm text-left">
      <thead><tr class="border-b border-[#262626] text-[#71717a]"><th class="py-2.5 pr-4">Setting</th><th class="py-2.5 pr-4">Default</th><th class="py-2.5">{id ? 'Keterangan' : 'Description'}</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody class="divide-y divide-[#1a1a1a] text-[#a1a1aa]">{internalDefaults.map(row => <tr><td class="py-3 pr-4 text-[#fafafa]">{row[0]}</td><td class="py-3 pr-4 text-[#71717a]"><code>{row[1]}</code></td><td class="py-3">{row[2]}</td></tr>)}</tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <Callout title={id ? 'Kompatibilitas API_KEY lama' : 'Legacy API_KEY compatibility'} tone="warning">
    {id ? 'Backend masih dapat membaca API_KEY bila operator lama memasukkannya secara eksplisit, tetapi docker-compose.yml default tidak lagi meminta atau meneruskannya. Jalur yang direkomendasikan adalah generated credential dari Pair WhatsApp.' : 'The backend can still read API_KEY when a legacy operator injects it explicitly, but the default docker-compose.yml no longer asks for or forwards it. The recommended path is the generated credential from Pair WhatsApp.'}
  </Callout>
</DocsLayout>
